{"duration_api_ms":99944,"stop_reason":"tool_use","session_id":"ce1c9f86-729b-4c6d-904c-b4ba73526b23","total_cost_usd":0.47886360000000006,"usage":{"input_tokens":54,"cache_creation_input_tokens":30528,"cache_read_input_tokens":1233868,"output_tokens":10987,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1131},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":30528,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1879,"cache_read_input_tokens":53639,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1220,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1220},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":54,"outputTokens":10987,"cacheReadInputTokens":1233868,"cacheCreationInputTokens":30528,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.47886360000000006,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":1131,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":34,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"status\":\"completed\",\"summary\":\"Configured >=512MB compressed zram swap on node1 via an Ansible playbook run from node2 (the control node with ansible-core installed). The swap is active at boot (generator-managed unit wired into swap.target) and preferred over disk swap via a higher priority (100 vs -2). Both node1 and node2 were restarted per the evidence protocol, each showing a changed boot identity and full recovery.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected node1 (RHEL 10, existing disk swap /dev/vda3 2G priority -2) and node2 (Ubuntu 24.04, ansible-core 2.20 pre-installed) to identify node2 as the Ansible control node\",\"Wired passwordless root SSH from node2 to node1 using the cluster-provided CLUSTER_SSH_PUBKEY/CLUSTER_SSH_PRIVKEY keypair\",\"Created Ansible inventory and playbook on node2 (/root/ansible-zram/) targeting node1\",\"Playbook installs zram-generator package, writes /etc/systemd/zram-generator.conf with zram-size = max(ram/2, 512) (yields ~980MB, exceeds 512MB minimum), compression-algorithm = zstd, swap-priority = 100 (beats disk swap's -2)\",\"Ran playbook: installed package, wrote config, activated /dev/zram0 as swap at priority 100 with zstd compression; verified via swapon --show and /sys/block/zram0/comp_algorithm\",\"Confirmed dev-zram0.swap is generator-managed and auto-wired into swap.target every boot from the config file -- no manual systemctl enable needed\",\"Captured healthy baselines (boot_id, uptime, swap state) on both nodes, then restarted node1 via async systemctl reboot, polled until reachable, confirmed new boot_id and zram0 swap auto-active post-boot (980M/zstd/priority 100)\",\"Restarted node2 similarly, confirmed new boot_id, then re-ran the playbook from node2 against node1 to prove full Ansible control-path recovery (idempotent run, changed=0, swap state intact)\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"node1 has >=512MB compressed in-memory (zram) swap configured via Ansible\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-d9d2a330428e4fea\",\"cmd-0608baffeee549bd\",\"cmd-c09082325cf547f1\"],\"summary\":\"zram-generator package availability confirmed, playbook written defining zram-size=max(ram/2,512) with zstd compression, playbook run shows /dev/zram0 activated at 980M (>512MB)\"},{\"requirement\":\"zram swap is preferred over disk-backed swap\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-c09082325cf547f1\",\"cmd-81353ad6c78c4127\"],\"summary\":\"swapon --show shows /dev/zram0 at priority 100 vs /dev/vda3 disk swap at priority -2, both before and after node1 restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"zram swap uses compression\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-5927f427e671414a\",\"cmd-81353ad6c78c4127\"],\"summary\":\"/sys/block/zram0/comp_algorithm shows zstd selected, confirmed both immediately after configuration and after reboot\"},{\"requirement\":\"zram swap is active at boot (persists across restart)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9962f93623e347c1\",\"cmd-a6514587cb4e4015\",\"cmd-81b336819dde4b3c\",\"cmd-81353ad6c78c4127\"],\"summary\":\"Baseline boot_id d9f8550d captured, reboot issued, node1 came back with new boot_id 5d081df6 and new uptime, with zram0 swap automatically active at 980M/zstd/priority 100 without any manual intervention\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart evidence: healthy baseline -> restart -> changed boot identity -> recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-9962f93623e347c1\",\"cmd-a6514587cb4e4015\",\"cmd-618b135dab184676\",\"cmd-b09e00c53073468e\",\"cmd-fd0b831970224658\",\"cmd-81b336819dde4b3c\",\"cmd-81353ad6c78c4127\"],\"summary\":\"node1 baseline boot_id/uptime/swap captured, reboot acknowledged before disconnect, polled through connection drop until reachable, new boot_id and uptime confirmed, swap and zram config verified healthy post-boot\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart evidence: healthy baseline -> restart -> changed boot identity -> recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-3d99ded16d584ba0\",\"cmd-5505567c657244ce\",\"cmd-ceec6de6a3b14493\",\"cmd-551541c73611444d\",\"cmd-df4023538802424e\",\"cmd-4d0141de6e1a4e58\"],\"summary\":\"node2 baseline boot_id captured, reboot acknowledged before disconnect, polled through connection drop until reachable, new boot_id confirmed, then Ansible control-plane functionality (SSH to node1, playbook run) verified fully recovered with idempotent zero-change result\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured >=512MB compressed zram swap on node1 via an Ansible playbook run from node2 (the control node with ansible-core installed). The swap is active at boot (generator-managed unit wired into swap.target) and preferred over disk swap via a higher priority (100 vs -2). Both node1 and node2 were restarted per the evidence protocol, each showing a changed boot identity and full recovery.","actions_performed":["Inspected node1 (RHEL 10, existing disk swap /dev/vda3 2G priority -2) and node2 (Ubuntu 24.04, ansible-core 2.20 pre-installed) to identify node2 as the Ansible control node","Wired passwordless root SSH from node2 to node1 using the cluster-provided CLUSTER_SSH_PUBKEY/CLUSTER_SSH_PRIVKEY keypair","Created Ansible inventory and playbook on node2 (/root/ansible-zram/) targeting node1","Playbook installs zram-generator package, writes /etc/systemd/zram-generator.conf with zram-size = max(ram/2, 512) (yields ~980MB, exceeds 512MB minimum), compression-algorithm = zstd, swap-priority = 100 (beats disk swap's -2)","Ran playbook: installed package, wrote config, activated /dev/zram0 as swap at priority 100 with zstd compression; verified via swapon --show and /sys/block/zram0/comp_algorithm","Confirmed dev-zram0.swap is generator-managed and auto-wired into swap.target every boot from the config file -- no manual systemctl enable needed","Captured healthy baselines (boot_id, uptime, swap state) on both nodes, then restarted node1 via async systemctl reboot, polled until reachable, confirmed new boot_id and zram0 swap auto-active post-boot (980M/zstd/priority 100)","Restarted node2 similarly, confirmed new boot_id, then re-ran the playbook from node2 against node1 to prove full Ansible control-path recovery (idempotent run, changed=0, swap state intact)"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"node1 has >=512MB compressed in-memory (zram) swap configured via Ansible","command_ids":["cmd-d9d2a330428e4fea","cmd-0608baffeee549bd","cmd-c09082325cf547f1"],"summary":"zram-generator package availability confirmed, playbook written defining zram-size=max(ram/2,512) with zstd compression, playbook run shows /dev/zram0 activated at 980M (>512MB)"},{"requirement":"zram swap is preferred over disk-backed swap","command_ids":["cmd-c09082325cf547f1","cmd-81353ad6c78c4127"],"summary":"swapon --show shows /dev/zram0 at priority 100 vs /dev/vda3 disk swap at priority -2, both before and after node1 restart"},{"requirement":"zram swap uses compression","command_ids":["cmd-5927f427e671414a","cmd-81353ad6c78c4127"],"summary":"/sys/block/zram0/comp_algorithm shows zstd selected, confirmed both immediately after configuration and after reboot"},{"requirement":"zram swap is active at boot (persists across restart)","command_ids":["cmd-9962f93623e347c1","cmd-a6514587cb4e4015","cmd-81b336819dde4b3c","cmd-81353ad6c78c4127"],"summary":"Baseline boot_id d9f8550d captured, reboot issued, node1 came back with new boot_id 5d081df6 and new uptime, with zram0 swap automatically active at 980M/zstd/priority 100 without any manual intervention"},{"requirement":"node1 restart evidence: healthy baseline -> restart -> changed boot identity -> recovered state","command_ids":["cmd-9962f93623e347c1","cmd-a6514587cb4e4015","cmd-618b135dab184676","cmd-b09e00c53073468e","cmd-fd0b831970224658","cmd-81b336819dde4b3c","cmd-81353ad6c78c4127"],"summary":"node1 baseline boot_id/uptime/swap captured, reboot acknowledged before disconnect, polled through connection drop until reachable, new boot_id and uptime confirmed, swap and zram config verified healthy post-boot"},{"requirement":"node2 restart evidence: healthy baseline -> restart -> changed boot identity -> recovered state","command_ids":["cmd-3d99ded16d584ba0","cmd-5505567c657244ce","cmd-ceec6de6a3b14493","cmd-551541c73611444d","cmd-df4023538802424e","cmd-4d0141de6e1a4e58"],"summary":"node2 baseline boot_id captured, reboot acknowledged before disconnect, polled through connection drop until reachable, new boot_id confirmed, then Ansible control-plane functionality (SSH to no